WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.593
Hello! My name is Alex.

00:00:02.843 --> 00:00:05.506
Nice to meet you. My name is Lea.

00:00:05.756 --> 00:00:07.260
Do you live here?

00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:10.912
Yes, I live in Berlin. And you?

00:00:11.162 --> 00:00:15.218
I live in Hamburg. I am here for the weekend.
